    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829700/extras/80de3fadeb4822b8d88d8ca08900cf72.avif?t=1694791588\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829700/extras/02992dfe8ab439d0b3ff696aca7b2805.avif?t=1694791588\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829700/extras/151f1e853aa51420f19aa37161a08d98.avif?t=1694791588\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829700/extras/1ba51ce4adc0e9ec5a8350547ba8588c.avif?t=1694791588\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829700/extras/377b5b51cfe855c1fcd7f989b0ce2394.avif?t=1694791588\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In the devastating grandeur of the post-apocalypse thirst is all that remains.<br><br>A thirst for... ACTION!<br>A thirst for... VIOLENCE!<br>And a thirst... for SPEED!<br><br>This thirst is known as SUPER BRAWL RUSH!!!<br>In SUPER BRAWL RUSH there are no losers, only legends...<br>There is only one thing to remember:<br><br>Race. Fight. Win!<br><br>Super Brawl Rush is a beat'em up set in the scorched post-apocalyptic lands of the near future. Choose your champion and fight your way to the top between swarms of bloodthirsty thugs, mutants and cultists.<br><br>Will you dethrone the Emperor and rule with an iron fist?  <br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A rip-roaring metal soundtrack!<br></li><li>Crazed enemies with unique attacks and weapons!<br></li><li>Exciting boss fights!<br></li><li>Adrenalinic car chases!<br></li><li>Multiplayer co-op for two players!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In the devastating grandeur of the post-apocalypse thirst is all that remains.<br><br>A thirst for... ACTION!<br>A thirst for... VIOLENCE!<br>And a thirst... for SPEED!<br><br>This thirst is known as SUPER BRAWL RUSH!!!<br>In SUPER BRAWL RUSH there are no losers, only legends...<br>There is only one thing to remember:<br><br>Race. Fight. Win!<br><br>Super Brawl Rush is a beat'em up set in the scorched post-apocalyptic lands of the near future. Choose your champion and fight your way to the top between swarms of bloodthirsty thugs, mutants and cultists.<br><br>Will you dethrone the Emperor and rule with an iron fist?  <br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A rip-roaring metal soundtrack!<br></li><li>Crazed enemies with unique attacks and weapons!<br></li><li>Exciting boss fights!<br></li><li>Adrenalinic car chases!<br></li><li>Multiplayer co-op for two players!</li></ul>",
